1
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:15,160
[Intro]

2
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:15,160
[Verse 1]

3
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:19,229
The Lord is my shepherd,

4
00:00:19,229 --> 00:00:22,340
and I shall want nothing.

5
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:25,851
In a place of green grass

6
00:00:25,851 --> 00:00:30,399
