7
00:00:30,399 --> 00:00:36,702
He has nourished me

8
00:00:36,702 --> 00:00:43,803
by the water of rest.

9
00:00:43,803 --> 00:00:43,803
[Verse 2]

10
00:00:43,803 --> 00:00:48,351
He has restored my soul,

11
00:00:48,351 --> 00:00:51,463
he has guided me

12
00:00:51,463 --> 00:00:55,612
in the paths of righteousness

13
00:00:55,612 --> 00:00:58,803
for his name's sake.

14
00:00:58,803 --> 00:00:58,803
[Chorus]

15
00:00:58,803 --> 00:01:02,154
Even if I should walk

16
00:01:02,154 --> 00:01:04,069
in the shadow of death,

17
00:01:04,069 --> 00:01:04,947
I will fear no evil,

18
00:01:04,947 --> 00:01:13,324
for you are with me.

19
00:01:13,324 --> 00:01:16,596
Your rod and your staff,

20
00:01:16,596 --> 00:01:20,266
they have comforted me.

21
00:01:20,266 --> 00:01:27,447
I will fear no evil.

22
00:01:27,447 --> 00:01:27,447
[Verse 3]

23
00:01:27,447 --> 00:01:30,479
You have prepared a table before me

24
00:01:30,479 --> 00:01:40,479
in the presence of those who afflict me.

25
00:01:42,048 --> 00:01:47,473
You have anointed my head with oil,

26
00:01:47,473 --> 00:01:53,298
and your cup cheers me like the best wine.

27
00:01:53,298 --> 00:01:53,298
[Chorus]

28
00:01:53,298 --> 00:01:56,729
Even if I should walk

29
00:01:56,729 --> 00:02:00,160
in the shadow of death,

30
00:02:00,160 --> 00:02:04,149
I will fear no evil,

31
00:02:04,149 --> 00:02:06,064
for you are with me.

32
00:02:06,064 --> 00:02:11,090
Your rod and your staff,

33
00:02:11,090 --> 00:02:14,761
they have comforted me.

34
00:02:14,761 --> 00:02:22,181
I will fear no evil.

35
00:02:22,181 --> 00:02:22,181
[Bridge]

36
00:02:22,181 --> 00:02:29,202
Your mercy shall follow me

37
00:02:29,202 --> 00:02:31,755
all the days of my life.

38
00:02:31,755 --> 00:02:41,755
Your mercy shall follow me

39
00:02:43,723 --> 00:02:50,904
all the days of my life.

40
00:02:50,904 --> 00:02:50,904
[Final Chorus]

41
00:02:50,904 --> 00:02:54,894
I will fear no evil,

42
00:02:54,894 --> 00:02:58,484
for you are with me.

43
00:02:58,484 --> 00:03:02,074
The Lord is my shepherd,

44
00:03:02,074 --> 00:03:06,622
and I shall want nothing.

45
00:03:06,622 --> 00:03:06,622
[Outro]

46
00:03:06,622 --> 00:03:12,766
And I shall dwell in the house of the Lord

47
00:03:12,766 --> 00:03:20,266
